# Tabs scroll to keep the one in front in view, within the strip, which with the explorer
# showing is 736 pixels and not 960. Ten tabs of 96 pixels are 960, which would fit in the
# window; with the tenth in front the strip begins at the fourth, seven tabs, 672 pixels,
# so the tenth is the seventh shown, x = 224 + 6 * 96 = 800, its accent underline there,
# 96 pixels of it.
